WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:09.564
It was a bright Christmas morning.

2
00:00:09.565 --> 00:00:11.656
Bada: Is it morning

3
00:00:11.657 --> 00:00:15.498
yet? My present! Hana, get up!

4
00:00:15.499 --> 00:00:18.771
It’s Christmas morning! Hana:

5
00:00:18.772 --> 00:00:25.136
Huh? Oh, yes!

6
00:00:25.137 --> 00:00:28.381
Bada: Where is my gift?

7
00:00:28.382 --> 00:00:30.044
Here it is! Wow,

8
00:00:30.045 --> 00:00:33.099
it’s heavy. Hana: Here

9
00:00:33.100 --> 00:00:39.281
is mine too. Bada:

10
00:00:39.282 --> 00:00:43.519
Wow, how cool! Dad, look! These

11
00:00:43.520 --> 00:00:49.921
roller blades are exactly what I wanted! All right! Hana:

12
00:00:49.922 --> 00:00:52.462
This camera is perfect. Thank

13
00:00:52.463 --> 00:00:56.915
you, Santa! Bada: Mom,

14
00:00:56.916 --> 00:01:02.109
may I try the roller blades right now? Mom:

15
00:01:02.110 --> 00:01:07.808
You can go out after you eat breakfast, Bada.

16
00:01:07.809 --> 00:01:11.462
