17
00:01:11.463 --> 00:01:18.592
Mom, please fix me some breakfast quickly!

18
00:01:18.593 --> 00:01:20.787
What a sweet day.

19
00:01:20.788 --> 00:01:33.227
Merry Christmas, everyone!

